translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_d731d0cd:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "But... Perhaps."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_a05da5f2:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Maybe...?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_5030e47d:


    MC @ think "What is it?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_fe040a89:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "What if... We didn't find a dark mage?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_89d1815c:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "What if one found me?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_8e801a35:


    MC @ think "I don't understand."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_d895b6ba:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "A dark mage's grimoire... If I could procure one, perhaps... I could use it to lure a dark mage to me?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_8e967385:


    MC @ think "And how do you plan to do that?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_27449a67:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "{i}... I claim to have in my possession a dark mage's grimoire and let it be known I'm looking to sell it.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_7cd89da9:


    MC @ talk "The inquisition will-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_e4672abd:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "They do not have official jurisdiction in Hamun."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_e050900a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "They could stomp their feet all they want."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_3677afaf:


    MC @ serious "Lord Tarbeck is bound to hear-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_f455be6d:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Leave that to me. I'll make sure only the {i}right{/i} people hear..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_234351d6:


    MC @ serious "My lady... Dark mages aren't something to be toyed with. One could come here and just try to kill you for the book!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_9ffe83cc:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "That's why I have you."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_9b6eb1e9:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "To help keep me safe."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_8bed84e0:


    MC @ sad "Lady Tarbeck..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_d909c161:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Would you do it for me? Would you find a grimoire?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_a017813b:


    MC @ serious "I don't exactly-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_cd351906:


    LADY_TARBECK @ sad "Please... I need your help."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_05e5a9be:


    MC @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Fine, I shall look for one... But no promises."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_8a98be5f:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "Thank you, [player_name], you won't regret this."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_48a77037:


    MC "(Where in the world am I going to find a dark mage's grimoire?)"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meet_manor_3e37c9ea:


    MC "(... Perhaps, Lord Zanzibat could help?)"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_0d8a2297:


    ZANZIBAT @ think "Oh... This will be interesting."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_5f24c996:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "What is it?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_0001f791:


    MC @ talk "Could you procure a dark mage's grimoire for me?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_d478afc1:


    "Lord Zanzibat stared at me for the longest time."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_dec747cd:


    ZANZIBAT @ laugh "Hahahahahaha!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_031bedfe:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "What possible reason could you have for one of those things?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_b737da3b:


    ZANZIBAT @ think "... Is this some kind of attempt to enhance your existing powers?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_1c8b8bb7:


    ZANZIBAT @ serious "I would strongly advise steering clear of anything to do with dark mages."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_2320ccc3:


    MC @ talk "No, it's not for me."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_36dd8be4:


    ZANZIBAT @ think "Then why?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_279dc081:


    MC @ talk "Can you procure it, or not?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_0f58feca:


    "Lord Zanzibat paused, his eyes curiously looking me up and down."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_e71ace15:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "... I could ask."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_329fb0b3:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "But the cost would be high."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_a18b100c:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Two thousand coins."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_f95f79d0:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Good."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_692fae93:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Hmm, very well."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_ef391e41:


    MC @ think "I suppose I can trust you to be discreet about this?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_ae02a7ac:


    ZANZIBAT @ smile "I'm almost offended..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_5b63858e:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "I haven't made it this far by learning how not to keep a secret."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_c18af7e8:


    "A slight smile appeared on his lips."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_cf16b615:


    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Just beware whoever you give this book to. It will be unlikely to stay a secret for long..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_first_36290245:


    ZANZIBAT @ smile "These things tend to get out rather quickly."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_repeat_03c177cd:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Now then, do you have the coin?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_repeat_5f8c5057:


    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Excellent."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_repeat_bdd014d3:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Return in a day or so. I will see what I can find."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_grimoire_repeat_552fe4d7:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Then return when you do."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_3152f5db:


    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Ahh... I was wondering when I might see you."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_26673cf3:


    "Lord Zanzibat handed over a cloth-covered book."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_757ec938:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Be careful with it..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_5537a1b3:


    ZANZIBAT @ talk "These books are often more trouble than they are worth."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_cf18f36a:


    MC @ talk "Thank you."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_zanzibat_pickup_grimoire_0aa70675:


    MC "(Now I just need to give this back to Lady Tarbeck and pray this plan of hers actually works.)"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_e2c706e0:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "Do you have it?!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_b1ff1c01:


    MC @ think "How did you-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_efbcda9a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Our spies told us that you visited Lord Zanzibat and that he has been inquiring about an... {i}unusual{/i} artefact recently."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_28876a17:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "Doesn't take a genius to figure out what happened."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_e7745e2a:


    MC @ talk "Yes, I have it."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_3323e72c:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "YES!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_52b44edb:


    "She clapped her hands together cheerfully."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_7b39c33a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "Show me."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_277399a6:


    "I handed over the book, shielded only by a brown rag. Lady Tarbeck traced her fingers over the cover and shuddered."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_b724b114:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "I... I can {i}feel{/i} something resonate from it."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_9b852a02:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "It's... So strange!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_25a6535e:


    "Lady Tarbeck took the book carefully from my hands."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_3307e770:


    MC @ think "What now?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_292aea3f:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "Now... I lay the bait."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_817f2b92:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Give me a day or two."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_bring_grimoire_fb89785a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Let's see if one of them really does take the bait..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_6d690ea9:


    LADY_TARBECK @ happy "I... I think we have something!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_e0672ca1:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "A buyer... Someone's coming here tonight to purchase the grimoire!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_f0c0bf3e:


    MC @ serious "Then I should be with you tonight."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_dc1c8514:


    MC @ serious "I'm not letting you put yourself at risk like this without some kind of security."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_40e0edee:


    "Lady Tarbeck's cheeks flushed red as her heart fluttered."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_6cf45c3a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ blush "Y-Yes... That sounds like a good idea."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_1d26c634:


    LADY_TARBECK @ blush "C-Come back here tonight, after dark."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_return_after_grimoire_23ec5c0a:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "I'll be waiting..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2e65774f:


    "No sooner had I entered the hall than I saw Lady Tarbeck speaking with a mysterious robed man."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_4d945cf3:


    "He tilted his head towards me, then began taking a few anxious steps back."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_b9f15549:


    LAZARIAN "T-There must be some mistake! Haha!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2e842d18:


    LAZARIAN "I am just a humble, uhh, collector!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_b959eb65:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "Wait, please!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a683778a:


    "The man tried to flee, but before he could, I stepped in front of him, holding out my hand to stop him."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a3d8555f:


    MC @ serious "Stop."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_fd48af92:


    LAZARIAN "I... I REALLY MUST GET GOING!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_9bc132f0:


    LADY_TARBECK "MY PARENTS WERE DARK MAGES!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_607572c5:


    "The man stopped in his tracks, slowly turning towards Lady Tarbeck."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2d864492:


    LAZARIAN "... What did you say?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_36da9442:


    LADY_TARBECK @ sad "My parents were dark mages..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_f5202e05:


    LADY_TARBECK @ sad "Please, this isn't a trap."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_c38aadc7:


    LADY_TARBECK @ sad "I need someone to... to..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_c78aada9:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "To teach me!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_311b7aee:


    "All at once, the man's entire body language changed, his voice becoming firmer."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_575b16e4:


    LAZARIAN "... You don't know what you're asking for."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_3a0d715b:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "I do! I have magecraft that I can't control! I-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_39e34f57:


    LAZARIAN "This isn't a game."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_1ef05a22:


    LAZARIAN "Do you even understand the risks of what you're asking?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_be89eb3e:


    LAZARIAN "The number of dark mages who go mad?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_8d3b4ca4:


    LAZARIAN "... You'll be hunted, despised, misunderstood..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_4cf395bb:


    LAZARIAN "{i}And one day you'll prove every bad thing they say about you right.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_906b022b:


    LAZARIAN "This isn't a life... Not really."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_3ffc3a73:


    LADY_TARBECK @ angry "I am who I am! I'm not running away anymore!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_087e5553:


    LADY_TARBECK @ angry "E-Either you'll help me, or I'll find another dark mage who will!"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_898123ad:


    LAZARIAN "Are you fucking mad?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a9cd5734:


    LAZARIAN "It's a miracle I arrived instead of-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_6eff7e95:


    "The man sighed, rubbing his brow."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_b3918224:


    LAZARIAN "... Fine, let's say I did teach you."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_97067f46:


    LAZARIAN "What's in it for me?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a0336920:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "C-Coin? I was thinking-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_28d01194:


    LAZARIAN "Not enough."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_84c5fbaf:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "What?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_e1cb3245:


    LAZARIAN "Eighty thousand coins... And a ship to the Dead Lands with a home waiting for me across the Black Ocean."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2fbfa867:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "That is..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_b677504a:


    LAZARIAN "My price."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_aaf972be:


    LAZARIAN "If you don't like it, good luck finding a non-crazy dark mage who won't try to teach you the joys of living turned inside out."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_28ed611b:


    MC @ serious "And how do we know you aren't just a crazy psychopath pretending he's alright until I turn my back?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a6cf9fa2:


    LAZARIAN "Well, you're both just going to have to have a little faith, aren't you?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_526d1806:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "The Dead Lands... But it's... so dangerous there."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_3288a5df:


    LAZARIAN "At least I'll be free."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_23f0a193:


    LAZARIAN "... So, do we have a deal, or not?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_bf6979b4:


    MC @ serious "Lady Tarbeck, you should think before-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_9c999f70:


    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Deal."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_8bb10932:


    LAZARIAN "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_772d4dbd:


    LAZARIAN "Fine, I'll come by tomorrow and begin teaching you."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_1d480bc9:


    LAZARIAN "This would normally take years, but... I suppose a crash course over a few months should at least leave you able to figure out the rest yourself."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_6aeb4841:


    MC @ serious "If you try-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_9856c44c:


    LAZARIAN "Relax, lover boy."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_8f160ee0:


    LAZARIAN "I can smell the two of you plan to fuck from here."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_4556ea76:


    "Lady Tarbeck's cheeks burned red."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_e92eb241:


    LADY_TARBECK @ blush "W-Wha...?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_00231d68:


    LAZARIAN "I only fuck the undead."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2d204a49:


    MC "..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_35dc0538:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "... I-"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_19bec968:


    LAZARIAN "... What? Did you think the dating pool was wide for a dark mage or something?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_972e0e4e:


    LAZARIAN "Besides, nothing beats a ghoul cheated on by her husband two centuries ago who's still after a little petty revenge."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_fbeb47f7:


    MC @ talk "Didn't need to know that."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_3d3852fa:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "When does the first lesson begin?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_7f27e67b:


    LAZARIAN "{i}Now.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_39dd6aa8:


    "... Until what felt like sunrise, Lazarian gave Lady Tarbeck a crash course."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_ff510a50:


    "Over the course of the next few days, Lady Tarbeck spent her time aggressively reading and practising circles and other strange incantations."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_7e1837c8:


    "Lazarian, for all his strange quirks... was a remarkable teacher, and he seemed equally impressed by Lady Tarbeck's insistence and questioning."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_1c1ec712:


    "At some point, Lady Tarbeck appeared before me... {i}differently.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_914e10b5:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "Well... What do you think?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_3205ad88:


    MC @ shock "You look..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_63e3404e:


    MC @ shock "{i}Different.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a79e0d24:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "It's strange... I can feel the energy coursing through my body more clearly now."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_ab2e11bd:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "It's like it's... changed me."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_0b5d023b:


    LAZARIAN "That's because it has... Now you're no longer suppressing it."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_c045f097:


    LAZARIAN "But now I think it's time {i}you{/i} took the next step."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_aa4c35e8:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "Which is?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a8cfde76:


    LAZARIAN "After doing some research, I am convinced the god you draw your magecraft from is Marvessa... An old god of indulgence."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_667267c3:


    LADY_TARBECK @ shock "Indulgence... Me?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_65bfeefc:


    LAZARIAN "Likely, your pious life has been the reason you've managed to suppress the power more easily."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_1a58234e:


    LAZARIAN "But now, if you want to unlock your powers fully... You need to indulge."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_f05ea4e9:


    LADY_TARBECK @ think "In what?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_5664a3d4:


    LAZARIAN "{i}Whatever your heart truly desires.{/i}"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_2987866c:


    "Lady Tarbeck paused for a moment, her eyes lighting with a strange sparkle as she turned towards me, saying nothing."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_b3ac5360:


    LAZARIAN "We can continue your training once you're done..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_9a977473:


    MC @ think "What are you going to do in the meantime?"


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_4498356e:


    LAZARIAN "Read... Swim in the waters, whatever I please."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_567c9320:


    LAZARIAN "{i}*Sigh*{/i} You people really are missing out on an undead brothel..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_200f6584:


    "Without another word, the dark mage slipped past, wandering off and leaving Lady Tarbeck and me alone."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_e1312f71:


    "Lady Tarbeck stepped closer to me."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_0a6a4ffd:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "So... I must indulge in my desires."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_a71ccec8:


    "She laughed softly."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_e4f9105e:


    LADY_TARBECK @ smile "And I suppose if I said..."


translate kr rom_tarbeck_darkmage_meetmage_568d1101:


    LADY_TARBECK @ blush "{i}You...{/i} were my desire..."


